This systematic review critically examines empirical research on retirement financial planning (RFP) in China, framed by the PRISMA guidelines and the “C‐RFP‐C” protocol. The protocol is registered at OSF (
 https://osf.io/f3nps
 ). Specialized databases such as EconLit, Business Source Premier, ABI/INFORM, Social Sciences Citation Index, and AgeLine were used, as well as multidisciplinary databases and Chinese‐language sources (CNKI and Wanfang). The search strategies employed yielded a total of 2035 documents related to RFP within the Chinese context. After rigorous screening and quality app
